msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUse112_01186:TEXT_GAIUSE112_01186_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "<ui-color 533><ui-edge-color 534><icon 63> This quest has been adjusted. Please abandon the quest and restart it by speaking to Slafborn in Revenant's Toll.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>※The Main Scenario Guide shows the next available quest. You can toggle it on and off in Character Configuration, under UI Settings."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アルフィノから、移転のための手伝いを頼まれた。砂の家をさがし「<sheet EObj 2002850 0>」を4つ回収しよう。
#. de: Alphinaud bittet dich, bei der Verlegung des Bunds der Morgenröte zu helfen. Hebe vier von <noun-de EObj 5 2002850 2 4 1> auf.
#. fr: Vous avez appris que les Héritiers ont pris un peu de retard sur leur programme. Alphinaud vous a demandé de l'aider pour gagner du temps. Commencez par récupérer toutes les affaires disséminées à l'intérieur du Refuge des sables.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUse112_01186:TEXT_GAIUSE112_01186_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Upon returning to the Waking Sands, Alphinaud declares that preparations for the move to Mor Dhona have fallen behind. Demonstrating an almost Slafbornian eagerness to put you to work, he then bids you scour the headquarters for any packages labeled for shipment to Revenant's Toll. It would seem your report will have to wait."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 砂の家で「<sheet EObj 2002850 0>」を4つ、回収することができた。砂の家にいる「タタル」に「<sheet EventItem 2001080 0>」を渡そう。
#. de: Du hast vier von <noun-de EObj 5 2002850 2 4 1> eingesammelt. Bring sie der fleißigen Tataru.
#. fr: Vous avez récupéré les affaires comme demandé. Portez-les sans attendre à Tataru.
#. kind: journal
#. macro: <sheet Race $gn71 0> — a value from a game data sheet, such as a name; sheet = Race, row = global number 71 (the player character's race, a Race row), column = 0 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUse112_01186:TEXT_GAIUSE112_01186_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "A cursory search yields four labeled packages. Though an average <sheet Race $gn71 0> might feasibly struggle to carry them all, the same cannot be said of you. Bluntly, you have faced greater challenges. Take the packages to Tataru who is waiting outside."
msgstr ""

#. ja: タタルに「<sheet EventItem 2001080 0>」を無事、渡すことができた。これで荷物は片付いたようだが、タタルには他にも頼みごとがあるようだ……。
#. de: Du hast Tataru <noun-de EObj 2 2002850 2 4 1> überreicht. Sie hat aber noch mehr Arbeiten für dich, die erledigt werden müssen.
#. fr: Tataru s'est réjouie de vous voir en possession des affaires qu'elle cherchait. Grâce à vous, sa liste contient désormais une tâche de moins.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/011/GaiUse112_01186:TEXT_GAIUSE112_01186_SEQ_04:1"
msgid "No sooner have you washed your hands of one errand than Tataru begs your assistance with another. With luck, it will take no longer than the previous one..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <ui-color 533><ui-edge-color 534><icon 63>本クエストは調整されました。一度破棄し、<br>レヴナンツトールのスラフボーンから再受注してください</ui-edge-color></ui-color>
